{"slug":"SzVMjhTnU10","lang":"en","author":"Whisper AI + translated by deepl","subtitles":[{"id":1,"startTime":0,"endTime":1.14,"text":"Iginari Explorers!"},{"id":2,"startTime":1.68,"endTime":2.74,"text":"Iginari Explorers!"},{"id":3,"startTime":3.16,"endTime":4.28,"text":"I am Waka Yasumori."},{"id":4,"startTime":4.28,"endTime":5.62,"text":"Yes, I am Shinju Yoshii."},{"id":5,"startTime":5.62,"endTime":7.08,"text":"Pleased to meet you."},{"id":6,"startTime":7.08,"endTime":7.56,"text":"Yes, please."},{"id":7,"startTime":7.56,"endTime":10.12,"text":"We are the Iginari Explorers! "},{"id":8,"startTime":10.12,"endTime":12.8,"text":"It's Waka and Shinju today."},{"id":9,"startTime":12.8,"endTime":13.22,"text":"Yes, ma'am."},{"id":10,"startTime":13.22,"endTime":14.9,"text":"You two are usually in an idol group called Iginari Tohokusan, right?"},{"id":11,"startTime":14.9,"endTime":18.74,"text":"You two are usually in an idol group called Iginari Tohokusan, right?"},{"id":12,"startTime":18.74,"endTime":19.22,"text":"Yes, sir."},{"id":13,"startTime":19.22,"endTime":20.68,"text":"I think it's important for idols"},{"id":14,"startTime":20.68,"endTime":24.24,"text":"I think it's important for idols to be loved by all generations."},{"id":15,"startTime":24.24,"endTime":25.12,"text":"That's right."},{"id":16,"startTime":25.12,"endTime":25.76,"text":"That's right."},{"id":17,"startTime":25.76,"endTime":27.28,"text":"I think it's important to be loved by every generation."},{"id":18,"startTime":28.608,"endTime":37.428,"text":"I think it's important to be loved by each generation, but you two are from the younger generation, so when you talk about feeling the feelings of each generation, I think you can understand the feelings of the younger generation, but it's hard to understand the feelings of the generation above you."},{"id":19,"startTime":37.428,"endTime":46.588,"text":"I think it's important to be loved by each generation, but since you two are from the younger generation, you can understand the feelings of the younger generation, but I think it's difficult to understand the feelings of the generation above you."},{"id":20,"startTime":46.588,"endTime":56.468,"text":"I think it's difficult to understand the feelings of the older generation."},{"id":21,"startTime":56.468,"endTime":58.544,"text":"I have prepared a project to help you understand the feelings of the older generation."},{"id":22,"startTime":58.544,"endTime":64.144,"text":"This time, we are going to explore the Showa era."},{"id":23,"startTime":65.824,"endTime":77.504,"text":"If you're Pearl, you've done the \"Bricko Expedition\" before, where you pretend to be Bricko and explore the world as if you're Bricko."},{"id":24,"startTime":77.504,"endTime":79.504,"text":"It's pretty strenuous."},{"id":25,"startTime":79.504,"endTime":82.104,"text":"You were your usual self, Pearl."},{"id":26,"startTime":82.104,"endTime":88.144,"text":"It was the same as usual, but we had a project in which we went around Kannai as Bricko."},{"id":27,"startTime":88.144,"endTime":88.176,"text":"That's right."},{"id":28,"startTime":88.176,"endTime":97.176,"text":"Today is the Showa era version, where we pretend to be people of the Showa era and explore the museum."},{"id":29,"startTime":97.176,"endTime":109.896,"text":"Today we're going to explore the museum as the people of the Showa period, and we're going to go to Jampara, which is located in the first floor of e-Beans."},{"id":30,"startTime":109.896,"endTime":116.936,"text":"But what would happen if two Showa guys went there?"},{"id":31,"startTime":116.96,"endTime":120.5,"text":"What do you think? Do you think it would be possible?"},{"id":32,"startTime":120.5,"endTime":127.46,"text":"Yes, I think so. They tell me nostalgic stories about their moms and dads."},{"id":33,"startTime":127.46,"endTime":135.96,"text":"They tell me things that I would never have heard in this day and age, so I guess it's kind of like that."},{"id":34,"startTime":135.96,"endTime":136.46,"text":"I see."},{"id":35,"startTime":136.46,"endTime":139.22,"text":"So it's kind of like you're getting by."},{"id":36,"startTime":139.22,"endTime":139.76,"text":"That's right."},{"id":37,"startTime":139.76,"endTime":145.2,"text":"I'm a pretty unimaginable Showa person."},{"id":38,"startTime":145.2,"endTime":149.2,"text":"Showa, but which Showa?"},{"id":39,"startTime":149.2,"endTime":161.2,"text":"Showa of the Showa era of the Showa era?"},{"id":40,"startTime":161.2,"endTime":169.2,"text":"You are free to choose, it can be your Showa, so don't mind if it's not Showa at all."},{"id":41,"startTime":169.2,"endTime":170.2,"text":"I see."},{"id":42,"startTime":170.2,"endTime":174.048,"text":"But please do not come back to 2021 after today."},{"id":43,"startTime":174.048,"endTime":178.768,"text":"The next time, since it started when you became Mr. Jampala..."},{"id":44,"startTime":178.768,"endTime":181.608,"text":"I understand. The screen is a little brown already."},{"id":45,"startTime":181.608,"endTime":183.608,"text":"Are you going to go that far?"},{"id":46,"startTime":183.608,"endTime":186.088,"text":"A little brown. That's not a chi cracker right now."},{"id":47,"startTime":186.088,"endTime":188.648,"text":"I want you to be thorough from there, so..."},{"id":48,"startTime":188.648,"endTime":192.408,"text":"I want you to explore today while we complete that mission."},{"id":49,"startTime":192.408,"endTime":193.408,"text":"Yes, sir."},{"id":50,"startTime":193.408,"endTime":195.728,"text":"Now, let's move on to Mr. Jampala."},{"id":51,"startTime":195.728,"endTime":196.328,"text":"Yes, sir."},{"id":52,"startTime":196.328,"endTime":197.088,"text":"Let's go."},{"id":53,"startTime":197.088,"endTime":198.528,"text":"Let's go!"},{"id":54,"startTime":201.018,"endTime":205.258,"text":"Here we are at Jampala."},{"id":55,"startTime":205.818,"endTime":208.818,"text":"What are you doing?"},{"id":56,"startTime":208.818,"endTime":211.978,"text":"Juliana?"},{"id":57,"s