,"startTime":276.728,"endTime":278.728,"text":"I wanna put it on!"},{"id":82,"startTime":278.728,"endTime":280.728,"text":"That's great! I want to wear it so bad!"},{"id":83,"startTime":280.728,"endTime":282.728,"text":"What do you think this is?"},{"id":84,"startTime":282.728,"endTime":284.728,"text":"You said you wanted to put the strap on."},{"id":85,"startTime":284.728,"endTime":286.728,"text":"What do you think it is?"},{"id":86,"startTime":286.728,"endTime":288.728,"text":"What's this?"},{"id":87,"startTime":289.728,"endTime":290.728,"text":"I don't know."},{"id":88,"startTime":290.728,"endTime":292.728,"text":"Why is there an apple on it?"},{"id":89,"startTime":292.728,"endTime":294.728,"text":"It's got an apple on it."},{"id":90,"startTime":294.728,"endTime":295.28,"text":"It's got an apple on it."},{"id":91,"startTime":295.28,"endTime":299.38,"text":"Maybe you're gonna use it. Like, to cut apples?"},{"id":92,"startTime":299.38,"endTime":304.28,"text":"Isn't it thick? You mean a knife that's not sharp enough?"},{"id":93,"startTime":304.28,"endTime":305.96,"text":"The knife is like this."},{"id":94,"startTime":305.96,"endTime":309.68,"text":"Cutting board! Cutting board for apple essen."},{"id":95,"startTime":309.68,"endTime":314.28,"text":"What do you want? Let's ask the shopkeeper."},{"id":96,"startTime":314.28,"endTime":316.28,"text":"Are you sure?"},{"id":97,"startTime":316.28,"endTime":319.28,"text":"Takuhn."},{"id":98,"startTime":319.28,"endTime":323.66,"text":"Kano Glory"},{"id":99,"startTime":323.674,"endTime":329.394,"text":"We don't know what this is, so we thought we'd ask you."},{"id":100,"startTime":329.394,"endTime":331.154,"text":"What is this for?"},{"id":101,"startTime":331.154,"endTime":333.474,"text":"This is called an iPhone."},{"id":102,"startTime":333.474,"endTime":334.854,"text":"iPhone?"},{"id":103,"startTime":334.854,"endTime":336.194,"text":"Yes, that's right, an iPhone."},{"id":104,"startTime":336.194,"endTime":337.154,"text":"iPhon