a Kaijin?"},{"id":203,"startTime":575.296,"endTime":579.296,"text":"He's my type, too."},{"id":204,"startTime":579.296,"endTime":583.296,"text":"I was wondering if you could recommend some products for me."},{"id":205,"startTime":583.296,"endTime":585.296,"text":"You have some interesting games."},{"id":206,"startTime":585.296,"endTime":587.296,"text":"Games! Games!"},{"id":207,"startTime":587.296,"endTime":589.296,"text":"I love them!"},{"id":208,"startTime":589.296,"endTime":591.296,"text":"I mean, we have a Game Boy and everything."},{"id":209,"startTime":591.329,"endTime":598.289,"text":"Let's go to the game section."},{"id":210,"startTime":598.289,"endTime":606.529,"text":"We went to the game section, but... you know... the people we know are a little different."},{"id":211,"startTime":606.529,"endTime":610.549,"text":"We're different. Or rather, we're similar."},{"id":212,"startTime":610.549,"endTime":616.329,"text":"There are a lot of weird patterns."},{"id":213,"startTime":616.329,"endTime":619.312,"text":"A 9."},{"id":214,"startTime":619.312,"endTime":621.312,"text":"It's like a mini-money."},{"id":215,"startTime":621.312,"endTime":622.312,"text":"Mini Monny?"},{"id":216,"startTime":622.312,"endTime":623.312,"text":"Jankenpyong"},{"id":217,"startTime":623.312,"endTime":625.312,"text":"Rock, paper, scissors!"},{"id":218,"startTime":626.312,"endTime":629.312,"text":"I've never seen this before."},{"id":219,"startTime":629.312,"endTime":632.312,"text":"It's a Nintendo Switch game."},{"id":220,"startTime":632.312,"endTime":634.312,"text":"Stitch?"},{"id":221,"startTime":634.312,"endTime":635.312,"text":"Stitch?"},{"id":222,"startTime":635.312,"endTime":637.312,"text":"Switch. Yes, sorry."},{"id":223,"startTime":637.312,"endTime":639.312,"text":"It's not PC Engine, is it?"},{"id":224,"startTime":639.312,"endTime":641.312,"text":"No, it's not PC Engine."},{"id":225,"startTime":641.312,"endTime":643.312,"text":"No Sega Saturn?"},{"id":226,"startTime":643.312,"endT