:726.056,"text":"It looks beautiful, doesn't it?"},{"id":252,"startTime":726.056,"endTime":730.576,"text":"Chobelibaan!"},{"id":253,"startTime":730.592,"endTime":736.192,"text":"Yes, so today, we were exposed to the culture of the times at Jampara."},{"id":254,"startTime":736.192,"endTime":740.272,"text":"It seems that not only do they sell them, but they also buy them."},{"id":255,"startTime":740.272,"endTime":741.892,"text":"Wow, what's that?"},{"id":256,"startTime":741.892,"endTime":744.552,"text":"We'd like to buy some of it back."},{"id":257,"startTime":744.552,"endTime":747.572,"text":"So we'd like to sell this one that we used today."},{"id":258,"startTime":747.572,"endTime":751.332,"text":"Excuse me, I'd like to sell this."},{"id":259,"startTime":751.332,"endTime":752.732,"text":"Yes, please."},{"id":260,"startTime":752.732,"endTime":755.272,"text":"This way is fine."},{"id":261,"startTime":755.272,"endTime":756.252,"text":"Yes, please."},{"id":262,"startTime":756.252,"endTime":758.292,"text":"I'll check it out."},{"id":263,"startTime":758.292,"endTime":758.892,"text":"Yes, please."},{"id":264,"startTime":758.892,"endTime":760.152,"text":"Yes, sir."},{"id":265,"startTime":760.592,"endTime":762.592,"text":"Pounding!"},{"id":266,"startTime":762.592,"endTime":764.592,"text":"When it comes to this one..."},{"id":267,"startTime":764.592,"endTime":766.592,"text":"I'm afraid your time is up."},{"id":268,"startTime":766.592,"endTime":768.592,"text":"What? Pien!"},{"id":269,"startTime":768.592,"endTime":770.592,"text":"If you knew, you'd know."},{"id":270,"startTime":770.592,"endTime":772.592,"text":"I'm a super Pien."},{"id":271,"startTime":772.592,"endTime":774.592,"text":"How did you do that?"},{"id":272,"startTime":775.914,"endTime":777.914,"text":"Like this one?"},{"id":273,"startTime":777.914,"endTime":779.914,"text":"It's a nice size."},{"id":274,"startTime":779.914,"endTime":781.914,"text":"And it's got a rug pen."},{"id":275,"startTime":781.914,"endTime":783.914,"text":"Oh, my God."},{"id":276,"startTime":783.914,"endTime":785.914,"text":"I'm sorry. I'm sorry."},{"id":277,"startTime":785.914,"endTime":787.914,"text":"I'm writing more."},{"id":278,"startTime":787.914,"endTime":789.914,"text":"You're not writing anymore?"},{"id":279,"startTime":789.914,"endTime":791.914,"text":"It's tradition."},{"id":280,"startTime":791.914,"endTime":793.536,"text":"What kind of things do you install?"},{"id":281,"startTime":793.536,"endTime":798.556,"text":"Of course, we can install older models."},{"id":282,"startTime":798.556,"endTime":803.636,"text":"But if it's too old, it's too late."},{"id":283,"startTime":803.636,"endTime":807.296,"text":"If it's too old, it's the one that's already finished..."},{"id":284,"startTime":807.312,"endTime":814.752,"text":"By the way, this one has a sticker on it, or it's chipped or broken."},{"id":285,"startTime":814.752,"endTime":817.712,"text":"Yes, it depends on the item,"},{"id":286,"startTime":817.712,"endTime":823.312,"text":"It depends on the item, but it may have scratches, no accessories, or some parts are missing,"},{"id":287,"startTime":823.312,"endTime":828.032,"text":"Some of them are broken, depending on your taste, but we can buy them back."},{"id":288,"startTime":828.032,"endTime":831.552,"text":"Wow, Jampara-san is so generous!"},{"id":289,"startTime":831.552,"endTime":833.312,"text":"Thank you very much."},{"id":290,"startTime":833.312,"endTime":835.312,"text":"Janpara is very generous!"},{"id":291,"startTime":835.312,"endTime":837.024,"text":"Janpara, you're so generous!"},{"id":292,"startTime":837.024,"endTime":843.824,"text":"Unfortunately, they didn't buy our favorite models."},{"id":293,"startTime":843.824,"endTime":849.424,"text":"I think I'll bring my phone next time."},{"id":294,"startTime":849.424,"endTime":851.924,"text":"Okay, our Windows 98..."},{"id":295,"startTime":851.924,"endTime":853.224,"text":"Oh, great!"},{"id":296,"startTime":853.224,"endTime":855.424,"text":"I'll come back and sell it to you next time."},{"id":297,"startTime":855.424,"endTime":859.424,"text":"I'll be looking forward to working with you."},{"id":298,"startTime":859.424,"endTime":861.424,"text":"I'm looking forward to working with you."},{"id":299,"startTime":861.424,"endTime":862.824,"text":"Nice to meet you!"},{"id":300,"startTime":862.824,"endTime":863.824,"text":"Gentle."},{"id":301,"startTime":863.824,"endTime":864.704,"text":"Hi!"},{"id":302,"startTime":864.704,"endTime":867.384,"text":"Let's go have a crepe then."},{"id":303,"startTime":867.384,"endTime":869.384,"text":"Oh, see you at Zagin!"},{"id":304,"startTime":869.384,"endTime":870.384,"text":"Sounds good!"},{"id":305,"startTime":870.384,"endTime":872.384,"text":"Shu Nakayama."},{"id":306,"startTime":872.384,"endTime":874.384,"text":"Bye bye."},{"id":307,"startTime":874.384,"endTime":876.384,"text":"Yes, so..."},{"id":308,"startTime":876.384,"endTime":878.384,"text":"It was a phone battle."},{"id":309,"startTime":878.384,"endTime":880.384,"text":"Thank you very much."},{"id":310,"startTime":880.384,"endTime":885.384,"text":"Not Showa at all, but Heisei and the people in the middle."},{"id":311,"startTime":885.384,"endTime":888.384,"text":"They handled it with great gusto."},{"id":312,"startTime":888.384,"endTime":890.384,"text":"It was amazing how well they handled it."},{"id":313,"startTime":890.384,"endTime":893.384,"text":"Thank you very much."},{"id":314,"startTime":893.642,"endTime":899.042,"text":"You didn't expect that they would be like this when they came to do the video, did you?"},{"id":315,"startTime":899.042,"endTime":901.242,"text":"It was like a crazy windstorm."},{"id":316,"startTime":901.242,"endTime":905.142,"text":"I'm sorry, but this is the expedition team."},{"id":317,"startTime":905.142,"endTime":907.142,"text":"Thank you very much."},{"id":318,"startTime":907.142,"endTime":910.142,"text":"It's kind of an advertisement, isn't it?"},{"id":319,"startTime":910.142,"endTime":912.142,"text":"Yes, it's true, it's an announcement."},{"id":320,"startTime":912.142,"endTime":914.642,"text":"It's a real advertisement. Let's have it."},{"id":321,"startTime":914.642,"endTime":915.642,"text":"Yes, thank you very much."},{"id":322,"startTime":915.642,"endTime":922.642,"text":"At Jampada Sendai e-building, we are strengthening the purchase and sale of PCs, smart phones, PC parts, and various other items!"},{"id":323,"startTime":922.784,"endTime":924.784,"text":"We are looking forward to your visit!"},{"id":324,"startTime":926.784,"endTime":933.784,"text":"We can't buy Gameboys and other items, so please leave your nostalgic items at home and come back to the store."},{"id":325,"startTime":934.784,"endTime":940.784,"text":"Please come and visit us at Giampada, located on the 1st floor of eBee's. We are looking forward to seeing you! Thank you very much."},{"id":326,"startTime":940.784,"endTime":943.784,"text":"Thank you very much for your time today."},{"id":327,"startTime":944.784,"endTime":946.784,"text":"Agepoyo!"}]}
